# Programs the tools in Bas/exile_tools build from the harnesses beside them.
# They are not tracked: they change with every kernel edit, they cannot be
# rebuilt without the game's disassembly (which this repo does not carry), and
# physics.bas embeds the game's own data tables.  Rebuild them with
# gen_phystest.py, gen_csubtest.py, gen_exiletest.py and test_objects.py.
physics.bas
physcsub.bas
exiletest.bas
objview.bas
